text.section:
The amount of the civil penalty for any act described in subdivision A 1 or 2 shall be as follows:

$50 for the first violation;


$200 for the second violation;


$500 for the third violation; and


$1,000 for the fourth and subsequent violations.
				After imposition of the penalty under this subsection, the amount of the penalty, if not paid within 30 days of receipt of notice of such penalty, shall bear interest at the rate of one percent per month until the penalty is paid.
